	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. P.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Priores humanitatis tuę literę sexta octobris <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>ad me datas, quibus adiunctus fuit siclus argen<lb xml:id="p1z3"/>teus, absente me uxori mę redditę sunt easque <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>integro fere mense post domum reversus primum ac<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>cepi.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Quę causa fuit, cur ad eas hactenus minus <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>responderim.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Ago autem gratias praestantię tuę summas <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>pro transmisso siclo, quem tu, cum ego plum<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>beum petiverim, argenteum dare voluisti, liberali<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>tate scilicet et munificentia me tibi prorsus de<lb xml:id="p1z10"/>vinciens.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Velim autem (quoniam indicem meorum <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>numismatum dudum accepisti) intelligere ex te possem, <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>num quae inter mea extarent, quę humanitas <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>tua desyderaret; curarem equidem ea tibi vi<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>cissim de meis pro libitu formari et referre pares.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>In pręsens, ut aliquo modo me declarem <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>gratum, mitto excellentię tuę <placeName>Nicophorum</placeName> de ar<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>chetypo aureo formatum, numisma non priscę illius <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>aut Romanę antiquitatis, sed <placeName ref="l1148">Constantinopolitanum</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>ab christiano imperatore percussum.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">In inscriptione <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>alterius lateris, in quo binę visuntur imagines, <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>non possum post has liters <foreign xml:lang="el">[griechisch]</foreign> reliqua, <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>ut aliquem habeant sensum, colligere.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Si quid <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>humanitas tua eorum assequi potest, quęso per otium <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>mihi communicato.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Gratiam item habeo pro libello, <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Summa scilicet verę religionis a domino <persName ref="p1227">Froschovero</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>tuo nomine mihi exhibito; alterum a <persName ref="p1283">Gesneri</persName> fratribus <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>non accepi.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Cupio autem humanitati tuę, quoquo <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>modo queam, vicissim gratificari ac inservire pe<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>toque, ut de benevolo erga te animo meo nihil du<lb xml:id="p1z30"/>bites et me habeas commendatum.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Bene vale, vir <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>ornatissime mihique colendissime.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="de">Dat[um] <placeName ref="l157">Franco<lb xml:id="p1z32"/>furti</placeName> kal. aprilis anno etc. 56.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z33"/>... <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>t<pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>issimo viro domino <persName ref="p495">Henrico [<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bull]ingero</persName> etc. domino et ami[co] <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>cum primis colendo.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z4"/><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
